  "summary": "The paper proposes QFM-CommNet, a quantum-walk-inspired Fourier operator framework for dynamic community detection, and evaluates it on LFR/SBM, Enron/DBLP, PPI/Brain fMRI, and Stock/Crypto networks. The reported best results are modularity 0.561, NMI 0.739, ARI 0.671, and temporal smoothness 0.593, with Qiskit simulator experiments using 20 qubits and QAOA depth p <= 3.",
